    domain: 'discrete',
    parent: 'partial-orders',
    summary: 'A poset in which every pair has a least upper bound (join) and greatest lower bound (meet). Lattices are where order theory meets logic — and they are the structure that makes dataflow analysis and abstract interpretation terminate.',
